<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Teselonqe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe Asunsis Xaafide Lam7intsa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Teselonqe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tese.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Lam7intsa Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiristtoosa lam7intsa ye7itilla afa denddide oochchii lalle medhdhitera hyanggide gisho Teselonqe woosa keetstsa madha gaanggi gaanggitera hyanggida. Phawuloosa Teselonqe asuntsis xaafide lam7intsa kiita, «Laatstsis ye7e qammita ukkida» yagaaze ammano timirttella afa mintsii ohida. Phawuloosa ohiter, Kiristtoosa yo7odeppa tiinii, «Gene atstsa» ga7inttize Kiristtoosa ixxiza kaalitser hyanna alamttilla afa iitatitsin genetitsi gaanggitera hyanggoda yaga7i un ammantto luulizane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaarize, madhan waaye gaanggikon un fa ammantte minggode fana ize eera fettilla yezuntsi oochchizanni fana, un fa yestis koshshize baz denggodes miinggi oochchode fana mahi lo77o oocha oochchodes suub ga7aame fana unttana mintsii zorane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galatan woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa lam7intsa ye7iti bazis ingginttide timirtte <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano yessi wogalla afa ingginttide zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xaatsi qofan saritse <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Phawuloosa, Sillaasen Ximotiyoosa Teselonqe woosa keetstsa yeze, Xoozze Aday bazin Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baz maaqqide asuntsis xaafide kiita.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Xoozze nu Adayppan Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosappa aadho keehatitsin sarotitsi yinttis maaqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Hawa. 17:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa ye7ize wode hyanode firdda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Nu ishuntso, yin ammanora yin fetay fetayan melluntsana siiqize siiqita gaama diccize gisho nuunii yinnis Xoozza ubba wode galatodes beezane. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Yinttana yellide bay7iten madha ubbanne gencceran ammanora miinggi eqqide gisho nuunii nu ommite Xoozze woosa keetstsa yin baz markkidhitera yinttalla ceeqinttane.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Yin E gisho ga7i madha ekkize Xoozze ka7itumos beezizuntsana maaqqii faydinttode fana Xoozze xillo firddas hyanna malla. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Xoozii turii firdda firddoda. Xoozii yinttana waaysizuntsalla afa waaye ko7oda. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Laatstse Yesuusa fa wolqqaama kiitanchchuntsara, saloppa ye7ize wode waayinttize yinttanan nuna shemppizoda. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Mahi Xoozii fana erosuntsanan nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggeles kiitinttoosuntsana tama loxera firddoda. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Un Laatstse tiinoppan E bonchcho wolqqappa shaakkintti medhina dhabe firdinttoda. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Yinna qammite, yin nu markkatitsito ekkii ammanizunts E bonchchinttodesin sabinttodes ye7ize wode nu yinttis ohide kiitto yin ammanide gisho yin eza bonchchizunts giddan sabbizunts gidda yessada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa. 2:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Nuunii yinttis ubba wode Xooz woossizanna yinnis. Nu Xoozze yinttana xeegide de7oos beezizuntsana maaqqii faydinttode fana nuunii woossane. Yin lo77o baz oochchodes amudhdhize amiton yin ammano oochito E fa wolqqara folo. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Yinne nu Xoozan nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsite, Laatstse Yesuusa suntsito yin bonchchoda; yinttanan E bonchchoda.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Gene atstsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Nu ishuntso, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa lam7intsa ye7itibaz nu eera yellinttode bazisin shiiqode bazis nu yinttana woossane. <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Tinbbitera woy melle asappa si7ide qaalara woy nuuppa ekkide kiita fana mahi, «Laatstsii maaqqii yi7ida» ga7i yin wozintta yirggippen so7ippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa. 2:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Yinttana ooden akko ogeran balitsife. Tiinii balitsize qonccikaayzin gene atstse ezin dhabe na7ay yi7ikaayzin, Laatstse lam7intsa ye7e qamma yelloos. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Asi goynize bazin xooz mahizebaz ubba ixxii fana dhoqi yiissada. Melle atto yezin, Xoozze keetstsa gelii bettii, «Taanii Xoozii» yagawuda.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Taanii yinttara yezitera yinttis ohidanno qoppoos yessane?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dane. 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Hiz. 28:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Ye gene atstse E fa qamma yo7oda fattin hyatte ye7aame fana akko eza teqqizako yin erane.<verse eid="2TH 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Asuntsis qonccikaayze genetits saza qofa hyatten oochchane, yezin hyatte eza teqqize yene. Eza teqqize ogeppa hyal7ide wode E qonccoda. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Yinnippa suuba, gene atstse qonccoda, yezin Laatstse Yesuusa fa doonttippa kezize kasora fa bonchcho ye7ite eza wodhoda. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Gene atstse Xalahe wolqqara yi7i worddo kille bazin gaama qofize malla bazi oochchoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa. 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Yinnii fanan, dhabes yeze asuntsana dumma dumma cimmize iita oochara balitstsoda. Un dhabidanna ashshize turiza kadhii ekkanxide gishos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Maato. 24:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Yinnii gisho, un worddo maaqqize baz ammanode fana Xoozii wolqqaama balitse unttalla dakkoda. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Yinnan, turo ammanoose asuntsi, nagara oocha ufayttizuntsi ubba firddinttode fana.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atotitsis doorinttide asuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Laatstsa kadhize nu ishuntso, nuunii Xoozza yin gisho ubba wode galatodes beezane. Yin attode fana Xoozii Geeshi Ayyaana wolqqara yinttana geeshidannen yinttin turo ammanidanne E yinttana anggis fana doorida. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Xoozii, nu yinttis ohize Wonggele baggara yinttana xeegide, yin nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosara wolla bonchchito shaakkinttode fana. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Yikke, nu ishuntso, miinggi eqqote. Nuunii yinttana nu doonara maaqqin woy dabddaabbera maaqqin tamaarsside timirttito aykkote.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16-17"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosan nuna kadhide fa aadho keehatitsite medhina mintsitsera lo77o ufayssi inggide Xoozze nu aday nu wozintto mintsitso; lo77o oocharan qaalara ubba mintsitso.<verse eid="2TH 2:16-17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Nuus woossote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Wurssutsite nu ishuntso, Laatstse qaala yin gidda ellisii dalggode fanan bonchchinttode fana nuus woossote. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Yinnii fanan, qaala si7ide ubba ammanoose gisho Xoozii genuntsappan iita asuntsappa nuna ashshode fana nuus woossote.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Yezin Laatstsii ammaninttidaya; E yinttana mintsitsodan Xalaheppa naagoda. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Nuunii yinttana kiittizanno hyatten tiinoppan yin oochchode fana Laatstsalla nuunii ammaninttane.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Laatstsii yin wozintto Xoozze siiqogon Kiristtoosa dandda7ago kaalitso.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oocha billikaayzara yezote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Nu ishuntso, yin nuuppa ekkide kiitto kaalloosuntsappan oocha ashshii azal7a ammanze asuntsappa yin shaakkinttode fana Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa tiino yinttana kiittane. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Nu fana hyanii yessades beezizanno yin, yin ommite erane. Nuunii yinttara yeze wode oocha ashshikaaya. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Nuunii oodeppan katstsa hyarii mu7ikaaya. Nuus dandda7inttide fana qamman awara oochchii labbii yezida fattin oodesin toofo maaqqikaaya. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Nuunii yinno oochchidanna, yinttis aazize maaqqades fattin yinttappa maade oocodes nuus adetits wolqqa dhabin baaya. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Nu yinttara yeze woden, «Oochchodes koyoose asi ooden mu7ippe» yaga7i kiittida.<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Nuunii yinno gayde, yin gidda fettii fettii azal7untsi yezanno si7ide gishos. Yentsi asuntsi geltsoose baza gelii melluntsana oocha billizane fattin akkon oochchoos. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Nuunii yentses fana asuntsi woga yessi yessade fanan koshshize baz oochchii denggode fana Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa tiino unttana kiittanen zorane.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Yezin nu ishuntso, lo77o oocha oochchodes azal7ippete. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Hyatte nuunii hyay xaafinttide dabddaabbizes kiitinttoosse asi ooden yeziko ye atstsa erote. E yeellidhade fana eeppa shaakkinttote. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Yezin eza ishe fana seerote fattin morkke fana bi7ippete.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi saritse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Saro inggize Laatstse, fa ommite yinttis ubba woden ubba baggara saro inggo. Laatstse yin ubbuntsara maaqqe.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Taanii Phawuloosa, hyay saritsiza ta kushera xaafida. Ta kiita ubbannis mallita hyanno; ta xaafizannan yinnii fana.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsi yin ubbuntsara maaqqe.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
